SUMMARY:Folds falling between the two characters of an escape
DESCRIPTION:A newline escape split by the fold\
 nfollows this word\, and an escaped backslash split by the fold\
 \ closes the value.
COMMENT:An escaped comma split by the fold\
 , then an escaped semicolon split by the fold\
 ; ends this comment.
